# The SCRIPT//GO API the website proxies /v1/* and /api/auth/* to. Read at BUILD time (next.config.ts):
# changing it needs a new build. Production: https://api.scriptgo.dev
API_URL=http://localhost:4100
# Optional: a local checkout of scriptgo-sdk to read the documentation from instead of the pinned tag.
# SCRIPTGO_SDK_DIR=../scriptgo-sdk
# The secret this website signs the visitor's address with for the API (x-sg-client; ADR-0042 in
# scriptgo-api). The same value as the API's SITE_FORWARD_SECRET, at least 32 characters, server-side
# only (never NEXT_PUBLIC_). Empty: the API sees this website's addresses (no player match by address).
SITE_FORWARD_SECRET=
# Optional: the header the host puts the visitor's address in. Default x-forwarded-for (first entry),
# which Vercel overwrites with the address it saw.
# SITE_CLIENT_IP_HEADER=x-forwarded-for
